{"id":2755,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>在第四届中北大学青年志愿服务项目大赛中，我院“知行宣讲团”申报的“理论星火燃基层·青春宣讲启新程”项目，凭借扎实的理论根基、创新的宣讲模式与扎实的基层服务成效，荣获提升型赛道金奖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LM4GM4L77bL7nfUo87PLNlaM7Q7LmWukU49aMmCsnR-4n7U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhfUYybUYyPMR7bLNrVnmM7olQkLmvZL4MfMR62nRf7nmAFMRrRnNlYozfFLlLDMzNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4LRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6305&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CAC9C14192EEF3D9FB27833A47FD0DF8/45CFE290/1C659\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 471px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LM4GM4L77bL7nfUo87PLNlaM7Q7LmWukU49aMmCsnR-4n7U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhfUYybUYyPMR7bLNrVnmM7olQkLmvZL4MfMR62nRf7nmAFMRrRnNlYozfFLlLDMzNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4LRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6305&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次获奖，是对“知行宣讲团”深耕基层理论宣讲、坚持理论与实践深度融合工作成效的高度认可。“知行宣讲团”将以此为契机，持续精进理论素养、优化宣讲形式，切实推动党的创新理论深入人心，引领青年学子在志愿服务中砥砺成长，贡献青春智慧与力量。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LM4GM4L77bL7nfUo87PLNlaM7Q7LmWukU49aMmCsnR-4n7U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhfUYybUYyPMR7bLNrVnmM7olQkLmvZL4MfMR62nRf7nmAFMRrRnNlYozfFLlLDMzNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4LRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6305&e=.jpg"}